export anchor MidnightGardenStyle:
    number: 272
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Midnight garden
    idea: Files hang like leaves along a drawn vine on deep night green, the selected file blooms as a moonlit flower, and its details open in an arched garden window.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #0c1611, page and style sheet
        bed: #12201a, leaf rows, storage bed, arch panel and search
        bedLit: #182a21, selected row and current nav
        vine: #3d5c48, stems, borders and line art
        ink: #edf1e6, text
        muted: #a9baa7, meta and inactive nav
        leaf: #8fd0a2, primary button, file icons, leaf markers, upload and storage growth
        moon: #f3e9c6, moon, Starred word and dashed focus
        petal: #eeb0ca, the selected flower, the selected edge and the Shared word
        leafInk: #0b2214, text on leaf
    type:
        One humanist stack, Optima, Candara, Segoe UI, Noto Sans. Base
        15.5px. The title is italic 40px at 500, the details title italic
        21px, file names 15.5px at 600, meta 13.5px muted and status words
        italic 13px.
    layout:
        A botanical line art vine with small leaves and petal dots runs
        across the top edge, over a leaf and moon mark with Brightwork
        Drive in italic and a leaf cornered search. Three columns follow.
        A 210px nav hangs the five places from a vertical stem, each with a
        small leaf, My files with a bright leaf and a lit fill, then a bed
        card with 64.2 GB of 100 GB used and a vine bar ending in a leaf.
        The middle has the breadcrumb, the italic title, Upload, New folder
        and a List or Grid switch, then a vertical vine down the left of
        the list. Each file row hangs from it on a leaf, folders on a bud
        and the selected file on a petal flower, and holds the name, an
        italic status word, date over person, and size. The selected row
        has a petal edge. A 330px arched panel holds Details, an arched
        preview window with a crescent moon, vines and the cover, the
        italic name, facts and the three buttons. Below 1180px the arch
        moves under the list. Below 760px all stacks.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 36px gutters and column gaps, 8px between leaf rows, 14 by 16px row padding.
    density: Medium. Eight rows hang from one vine with room for the line art.
    corners: Leaf shaped, 16px on two opposite corners and 3px on the others. The details panel is a 170px arch over 18px feet.
    borders: 1px vine green on panels and rows, a 2px vine line down the list and the nav, a petal edge on the selected row.
    shadows: None. Light comes from the moon, cream and petal accents.
    icons:
        18px line icons in leaf green. Rows hang from leaves, folders from
        buds and the selected file from a flower. Italic status words pair
        a filled star with Starred in moon cream, two heads with Shared
        with 4 people in petal and an up arrow ring with Uploading, 62% in
        leaf over a growth bar.
    focus: A 2px dashed moon cream outline with a 3px offset.
    tone: Gentle and plain, such as Details and 64.2 GB of 100 GB used.
